## Testing Standards

### Viewport Testing
- Mobile (320px - 480px)
- Tablet (481px - 768px)
- Desktop (769px+)
- Large screens (1200px+)

### Interaction Testing
- Touch events
- Mouse events
- Keyboard navigation
- Screen reader compatibility

### Performance Metrics
- Layout shift scores
- Interaction timing
- Load performance
- Animation frames

